<title>UK: World Bank sets 500 million rand one-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 500 million rand one-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credito Italiano and Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.375    MATURITY    30.JUN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.95    PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    100.05    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/GB/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.90</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
